<title>USA: Bangor Hydro says it suspends qtrly div.</title>
<headline>Bangor Hydro says it suspends qtrly div.</headline>
<text>
<p>BANGOR, Md., April 14 Reuter - Bangor Hydro-Electric Co said Monday it suspended its common stock dividend and filed with the Maine Public Utilties Commission for rate increases.</p>
<p>The company said it is also working with its lending banks on its ability to comply with various covenants contained in the lending agreement.</p>
</text>
